OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland workers 'in limbo' over
OL,4,Afirm's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Poundland worker has said staff are
OL,7,Ffeeling "in limbo" waiting to hear the
OL,8,Ffate of the business weeks before
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FThe discount retailer, which employs
OL,12,Fabout 11,000 people, was put up for
OL,13,Fsale in September by owners US
OL,14,Finvestment firm Gordon Brothers, and
OL,15,Fnow faces going into administration,
OL,16,Fdespite offers on the table to buy it.
OL,18,FKelvin Blake, 62, who has been with
OL,19,FPoundland in Birmingham for 25 years,
OL,20,Fsaid his partner also worked for the
OL,21,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
