OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland workers 'in limbo' over
OL,4,Afirm's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deadline to secure a buyer for the
OL,7,Fdiscount chain is to expire at midnight
OL,8,Fon Wednesday, after a court gave the
OL,9,Fowners extra time to find one.
